The castle level would usually have a boulder sitting in the corridor.  Using
the wand of digging, you might be able to manipulate the boulder into the 
moat and make yourself a passage-way into the castle.  The force-bolt spell
will destroy the door.  If you can't find an appropriately located boulder,
cast the spell anyway and hang around directly in front of the gateway.  
Eventually, a titan will throw a boulder your way.  Be sure you're well
protected with intrinsics though.  Good luck!

